WEBVTT

00:02:58.863 --> 00:03:03.736
in regions of water scarcity
and heavy industrial development.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.627
And I saw that
in northern China and in India.

00:03:07.736 --> 00:03:12.146
But I was surprised
when I read a 2018 article

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:16.734
where there's 232 river-sampling sites

00:03:16.758 --> 00:03:19.321
sampled across the United States.

00:03:19.345 --> 00:03:21.000
And of those sites,

00:03:21.024 --> 00:03:24.515
37 percent had increasing salinity levels.

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:26.926
What was more surprising

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:29.783
is that the ones
with the highest increases

00:03:29.807 --> 00:03:32.712
were found on the east part
of the United States,